{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding\/PostHogBatchEncoder"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" of PostHog’s batch capture API, so an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can send events to PostHog Cloud or a self-hosted PostHog’s "},{"code":"POST \/batch\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/posthogencoding\/posthogbatchencoder"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:15PostHogEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV","title":"PostHogBatchEncoder","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PostHogBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/PostHogEncoding\/PostHogBatchEncoder.swift#L78"},"modules":[{"name":"PostHogEncoding"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PostHogBatchEncoder"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PostHogBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding\/PostHogBatchEncoder\/init(projectToken:plan:limit:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding\/PostHogBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding\/PostHogBatchEncoder\/Failure"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHog